                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "85888846-b303-360f-b208-2d2cd0ac8586",
                        "entry_id": "f61a3188-3d77-3f81-b819-263e83d03ab3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "орнитол. небольшая перелётная светло-серая певчая птица семейства мухоловковых; лат. Erithacus rubecula"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "067eb968-776e-4ef6-9874-284eba38a8e5",
                                "sense_id": "85888846-b303-360f-b208-2d2cd0ac8586",
                                "text": "Слышу, малиновка где-то запела, за нею другая, // И раздалися в кустах голоса, будто праздник великий // Вольные птички встречали…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f0b88ea-1b0f-470f-9b65-3be1f6d72d90",
                                "sense_id": "85888846-b303-360f-b208-2d2cd0ac8586",
                                "text": "Малиновки заслышав голосок, // Припомню я забытые свиданья, // В три жердочки берёзовый мосток // Над тихою речушкой без названья."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4236d086-65aa-4442-9ea1-493395c3dc95",
                        "source_entry_id": "f61a3188-3d77-3f81-b819-263e83d03ab3",
                        "source_sense_id": "85888846-b303-360f-b208-2d2cd0ac8586",
                        "source_sense_description": "птица",
                        "target_lang_word": "redbreast",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "redbreast",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7034e22-1282-3818-81bd-b7e339550b05",
                                        "entry_id": "2958f689-dc16-310e-93ae-fac8b92579dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several unrelated birds that have a red breast",
                                            "A European robin, Erithacus rubecula."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9c4e215-4064-4212-a4fb-584ccf172343",
                                                "sense_id": "c7034e22-1282-3818-81bd-b7e339550b05",
                                                "text": "There was a pleasant frosty sun glittering through the twigs of the leafless shrubs, and flashing on the ripples and undulations of the Liffey, and the redbreasts and sparrows were picking up the crumbs which the housekeeper had thrown for them outside."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96157059-a2fe-4966-bc55-0b12aa8de2a9",
                                                "sense_id": "c7034e22-1282-3818-81bd-b7e339550b05",
                                                "text": "I felt comforted by the song of the redbreast, and I thought I felt less lonely and deserted as long as I heard the merry notes of the thrush."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "747e4cde-a0e0-3162-9cff-06133fafc837",
                                        "entry_id": "2958f689-dc16-310e-93ae-fac8b92579dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several unrelated birds that have a red breast",
                                            "An American robin, Turdus migratorius."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "52a7c966-c4ee-4a40-99fa-b7ac4e64aa31",
                        "source_entry_id": "f61a3188-3d77-3f81-b819-263e83d03ab3",
